{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026huNpOz97Q11795651409.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國聯邦儲備局發表褐皮書，發現近幾星期，多數轄區經濟實現輕微至溫和增長，企業則反映薪金壓力上升。</p><p></p><p>根據有關調查，12個轄區中，有8個轄區報告經濟錄得增長，4個轄區無變化。就業水平亦小幅度上升，價格整體溫和上漲。報告提到薪金及福利溫和上升，並較上一份報告中的小幅增長有所加快，主要受到難以填補的職缺空缺，薪金上升壓力推動，以及受到生活成本調整，及福利成本上漲影響。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T00:57:56.051558+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T00:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:17:12.245394+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T00:51:17.014643+00:00","content_hash":"a7b1b497f9dbb927fdb3979b2968a522943be3881477b3e87770143ab57bd613","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T00:57:56.051558+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}